  x_help: 'Writing the tree in Excel\nIn the People sheet, one row per person. The ID is any unique code you choose (1, 2, 3…). Write the parents’ IDs in “Father ID” and “Mother ID”, and the tree builds itself.\nDates: 1985-03-12 for a full date, or 1985-03, or 1985. For Hijri put h first: h1380-07-15 or h1380. For “about” put ~ first: ~1950.\nDeceased: write Yes. Gender: Male or Female.\nThe Marriages sheet is optional: one row per marriage with the husband’s and wife’s IDs and the date; when a father had several wives, give the children their mother’s ID.\nGrey columns are for reading only and are not restored.\nAfter editing: in the app, Export → Restore, and choose the file.',
